---
interface Props {
  greeting: string;
  location: string;
  tagline: string;
}
const { greeting, location, tagline } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="hero-logo-wrap">
  <div class="ascii-art-box" aria-label="UdeM AI ASCII Art Banner">
    <pre id="udem-ascii-banner" class="ascii-pre">
   ██╗   ██╗██████╗ ███████╗███╗   ███╗     █████╗ ██╗
   ██║   ██║██╔══██╗██╔════╝████╗ ████║    ██╔══██╗██║
   ██║   ██║██║  ██║█████╗  ██╔████╔██║    ███████║██║
   ██║   ██║██║  ██║██╔══╝  ██║╚██╔╝██║    ██╔══██║██║
   ╚██████╔╝██████╔╝███████╗██║ ╚═╝ ██║    ██║  ██║██║
    ╚═════╝ ╚═════╝ ╚══════╝╚═╝     ╚═╝    ╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═╝
  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │  ∇L(θ) · ∑ P(z|x) · π*(s) · UdeM AI Research Lab  │
  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</pre>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-subtitle-bar">
    <div class="club-title">{greeting} <span style="color: var(--color-accent);">{location}</span></div>
    <div class="club-tagline">{tagline}</div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .ascii-art-box {
    width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.35rem 0;
  }
  .ascii-pre {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(0.55rem, 1.35vw, 0.86rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.35);
    user-select: none;
  }
</style>
